This product includes a JavaScript translation of YAMNet's feature computation (features.py, params.py)
and YAMNet's class map (yamnet_class_map.csv, as classes.js), from https://github.com/tensorflow/models,
research/audioset/yamnet, at commit c14bf9ad91962cf189f9f58db2132c06247fcd53, Copyright 2019 The TensorFlow
Authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The changes are listed in README.md (How it works).

The class names and ids are those of the AudioSet ontology (https://github.com/audioset/ontology), made
available by Google Inc. under a Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0)
license.

The model is not included. tag.js reads a conversion of YAMNet's weights (yamnet.h5, Apache-2.0, Google)
from opts.weights, the neural cache, or its hosted copy; scripts/export.py makes it.
